      "turn": 1,
      "quote": "The brackets are for your own memories, so the speech sounds like you.",
      "note": "It recognizes that personal memories need the user's input, but should also have checked the desired tone and whether the user wanted to mention the abuse before drafting the rest as first-person speech."
